From: SupeChicken666 <me@supechicken666.dev>
Date: Sat, 28 Feb 2026 15:18:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix building on A16 (rebased onto lineage-24.0 by hand)

Context of libstagefright cflags changed upstream, so the patch from
waydroid-patches/base-patches-37 (frameworks/av 0028) was ported manually.

Change-Id: Ic5cca0de67411481d506298ef9b61b166ee24102
---
 media/libstagefright/Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/media/libstagefright/Android.bp b/media/libstagefright/Android.bp
index 73faf3a..91e0770 100644
--- a/media/libstagefright/Android.bp
+++ b/media/libstagefright/Android.bp
@@ -396,6 +396,7 @@ cc_library {
         "-Werror",
         "-Wno-error=deprecated-declarations",
         "-Wno-multichar",
+        "-Wno-unused-but-set-variable",
     ] + select(soong_config_variable("stagefright", "target_disable_thumbnail_block_model"), {
         true: ["-DDISABLE_BLOCK_MODEL"],
         default: [],
